---
const services = [
  {
    title: "Automation & AI",
    description: "Sviluppo e integrazione di assistenti intelligenti e processi automatizzati",
    icon: "cpu"
  },
  {
    title: "Data Analysis & Dashboarding",
    description: "Analisi strategiche e report visivi per decisioni data-driven",
    icon: "bar-chart"
  },
  {
    title: "Software & Web Development",
    description: "Custom software e piattaforme web.",
    icon: "code"
  },
  {
    title: "Digital Innovation & Communication",
    description: "Strategie di marketing e comunicazione basate su dati e creatività",
    icon: "message-circle" 
  }
];
---

<section id="cosa-faccio" class="section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Cosa Faccio</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">DOVE I DATI INCONTRANO LE PERSONE</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="intro-content">
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>
          Mi occupo di <strong class="highlight">AI e automazioni</strong>, <strong class="highlight">analisi dei dati</strong> e <strong class="highlight">sviluppo di piattaforme web</strong>, accompagnando le imprese nella loro evoluzione digitale.
        </p>
        <p>
          Aiutare a comprendere e utilizzare il digitale in modo pratico, accessibile e coerente con la loro identità è la mia <strong>MISSIONE</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Coniugo tecnica e visione strategica: Analizzo dati e progetto dashboard per ottenere insight necessari a migliorare la strategia, sviluppo software e creo <strong class="highlight">workflow intelligenti</strong> per migliorare processi e produttività.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-visual">
         <div class="image-wrapper img-1">
           <img src="/SaraAIFestival.JPG" alt="Sara a AI Festival" />
         </div>
         <div class="image-wrapper img-2">
           <img src="/SaraAIFestival2.JPG" alt="Sara Speaker" />
         </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      {services.map(service => (
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="icon-box">
             <!-- Placeholder icon logic -->
             <div class="icon-circle"></div>
          </div>
          <h3>{service.title}</h3>
          <p>{service.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="cta-container">
      <a href="#contatti" class="btn btn-primary">Connettiamoci!</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-alt {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  /* Split Layout */
  .intro-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .intro-text {
    text-align: left;
    max-width: none; /* Reset max-width constraint */
    margin: 0;
  }

  .intro-text p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #cccccc;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Visual Grid on Right */
  .intro-visual {
    position: relative;
    height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }

  .image-wrapper img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* First Image: Back, larger, tilted left */
  .img-1 {
    width: 280px;
    height: 380px;
    top: 10px;
    left: 20px;
    z-index: 1;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    filter: brightness(0.7);
  }

  /* Second Image: Front, slightly smaller but focal, tilted right */
  .img-2 {
    width: 260px;
    height: 340px;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 20px;
    z-index: 2;
    transform: rotate(3deg) translateY(20px);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  /* Interactive Hover */
  .intro-visual:hover .img-1 {
    transform: rotate(-5deg) translateX(-15px) scale(0.95);
    filter: brightness(1);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .intro-visual:hover .img-2 {
    transform: rotate(5deg) translateX(15px) scale(0.95);
    z-index: 1; /* Swap depth on hover */
    filter: brightness(0.5);
  }

  .intro-visual:hover .img-2:hover {
    filter: brightness(1);
    z-index: 3;
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  /* Services Grid */
  .services-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .service-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem);
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
  }

  /* Stacking offsets */
  .service-card:nth-child(1) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(2) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 4rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(3) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 6rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(4) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 8rem); }

  .service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .icon-box {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-container {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 100;
  }


  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .intro-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .intro-text {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .intro-visual {
      order: -1; /* Pictures first on mobile/tablet */
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
